OL,3,GNEWSADoctor was 'misled' by circumcised
OL,4,Aboy's mother
OL,5,
OL,6,FA doctor who circumcised a
OL,7,Fseven-year-old boy without his father's
OL,8,Fconsent can continue to practise as his
OL,9,Factions do not amount to misconduct, a
OL,10,Fmedical tribunal has determined.
OL,12,FDr Balvinder Mehat circumcised the boy
OL,13,Fat a medical centre in Nottingham after
OL,14,Fhis mother asked for the procedure to
OL,15,Fbe carried out, without any knowledge
OL,16,Fof the father.
OL,18,FThe mother was married to the father at
OL,19,Fthe time but she had not named him on
OL,20,Fthe birth certificate, and she also did
OL,21,Fnot mention the father on a
OL,22,Fcircumcision consent form she signed.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,369,360,200,160,0,100
