OL,3,GNEWSADoctor was 'misled' by circumcised
OL,4,Aboy's mother
OL,5,
OL,6,FMehat's barrister, Ghazan Mahmood,
OL,7,Ftherefore argued that Mehat had been
OL,8,F"misled" by the mother, and was not
OL,9,Faware the boy's father also had
OL,10,Fparental responsibility.
